1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:11,393
On that thin diet Varma weakens, and pills and tonics take the place of food: for his bowels, his blood pressure, his arthritis, and finally to keep his heart beating.

2
00:00:11,393 --> 00:00:15,807
There are rushes to hospital and the humiliation of the stomach pump.

3
00:00:15,807 --> 00:00:20,638
When the old man begs, let me die, his son replies that he has his duty.

